      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a bug that many of my friends have been experiencing, including myself. This doesn't just include the features of 3.0 with toggles and such, but also hand gestures as well. Problem can be reproduced by joining a world with other 3.0 users.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5f9caa418a49b158d0c282fb",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5adf9ff2a2fe006ef1505182",
        "alias": "Flexible Emu",
        "aliasID": "65ba09b9ed6eefce4cc7fa12",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/9846c9ddd9c196bec310ef8056b1d121.png",
        "created": "2018-04-24T21:21:54.593Z",
        "name": "KillFrenzy",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "evan-tran"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2020-10-31T00:05:21.864Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5f98eafb37c88b790ad5cda1",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems this issue occurs across all layers, except for the Base Layer (I think it uses a different type of sync). Hand gestures will stop working as well (stuck on idle). Action layer animations will cause the avatar to do a TPose (only when the issue is active). FX Layer will do nothing. These issues only occur for other people, not the one using the avatar.\nThe issue is extremely frequent and has a high chance of occurring, but I am unsure how to reliably reproduce or avoid the issue. Reuploading the avatar and having everyone download it the first time seems to make it work correctly. Reloading the avatar in any way can break it again (or sometimes fix it).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
